From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Luke Craig <lacraig3@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 12:07:10 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] replay: guard guest state against analysis mutations

Validate callback policies before preparing and starting RR. Refuse analysis writes, faulting accesses and device reads during record/replay. Provide a recoverable PC setter while preserving the old noreturn contract.

SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later

Origin: new
---
